Package: hyprtrixie
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Ahmadlolbit <ahmadyassin714@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: git, openssh-client, ca-certificates, sudo
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Ahmadlolbit/hyprtrixie
Description: Debian 13 with Hyprland, set up properly
 Hyprtrixie sets up Hyprland on Debian 13 with a guided setup, sensible
 defaults and real options, and keeps a snapshot before every change.
 .
 The package puts a clone of the release in /opt/hyprtrixie, with its
 programs already built; hyprtrixie update moves it to newer signed
 releases.
